23. QUALITY VALIDATION

Every generated conversation should be validated.

Checks should include:

* Correct category
* Correct expected alert status
* Correct number of participants
* Correct conversation structure
* Appropriate semantic relationship to alert concept
* Appropriate difficulty
* RFC 822 validity
* No accidental source-content copying
* No real PII leakage
* No unintended category crossover

If validation fails:

REJECT → REGENERATE

